summary:
  The wake tone's flowed-audio evidence goes out of reach — an audible
  station gets ruled dead again.

history:
  Measured live 2026-08-10 23:08:46, from the fallback's own evidence
  line: playing=true, position=24917, mediaStatus=4. A live stream plays
  for minutes sitting in BufferingMedia and never reaches BufferedMedia,
  and the status-only gate replaced a station the sleeper could hear
  with the chime — the one thing a wake-up may never do to a working
  wake-up. The position floor is the fix; this mutant raises it out of
  reach, which is what any "tidy the magic number" edit would do.

target:
  package/contents/ui/AlarmLogic.js

find:
  var WAKE_STARTED_MS = 5000;

replace:
  var WAKE_STARTED_MS = 99999999;

expect:
  Killed by tst_alarmengine.qml
  test_a_station_that_streamed_stands_the_tone_down: position 24917 no
  longer clears the floor, the tone fires over the playing station and
  the faded-count compare goes red.
